Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.46,0:06:56.67,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}you don't want to talk about something, it's OK, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.87,0:07:01.37,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你真的不想喝杯咖啡什么的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.87,0:07:01.37,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You sure we can't get you any coffee, a...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:02.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不用了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:02.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:05.51,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你担心你的前夫吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:05.51,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You worried about your ex?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:09.98,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没关系 我们不查他 没人要查他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:09.98,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's OK. We are not looking at him, and nobody wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:13.63,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那你们想从我这里找到什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:13.63,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, what are you looking for, from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:17.61,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你的看法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:17.61,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, perspective, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:20.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}2002年出了些事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:20.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Something went down, 2002.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:24.28,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你前夫的搭档 拉斯丁 科尔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:24.28,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Your ex-husband's partner, Rustin Cohle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:27.47,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我曾经被那些自命不凡的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:27.47,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}In a former life, I used to exhaust myself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:30.15,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}粗鲁男人搞得精疲力尽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:30.15,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}navigating crude men who thought they were clever,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.49,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以有问题就问 不然我就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.49,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}so ask your questions or I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不愧是警察老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's a cop's wife, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:37.24,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不再是了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:37.24,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们不是想咋呼你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We're not trying to work you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:40.83,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:40.83,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Word of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:44.86,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们想知道2002年拉斯丁 科尔的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:44.86,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We need to know about Rustin Cohle in 2002.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:47.84,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他为什么辞职 之后干了些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:47.84,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why he took off, what he'd done since.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:51.63,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}索耶太太 02年之后你跟科尔联系过吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:51.63,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Have you had any contact with Cohle, Mrs. Sawyer, since 2002?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:54.10,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 没有 - 但是你跟他很熟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:54.10,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- No, I haven't. - But you knew him well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.49,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他曾是你丈夫的搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.49,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I mean, he was your husband's partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:58.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}拉斯特? 确实 我认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:58.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Rust? Yeah, I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:00.41,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是并没有那么了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:00.41,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Not as well as other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:02.82,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为什么你们会问起他?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:02.82,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why, exactly, are you asking about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:04.76,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}发生了一些不好的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:04.76,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Something bad happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:06.98,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}也许跟科尔有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:06.98,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Maybe Cohle's involved.
