Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:09.89,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}More we look at him, it don't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:14.08,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}很久以前 他遇到过一些很糟的事
