Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:17.26,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I knew Rust to be a good man,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:19.99,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以我不知道我有什么好说的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:19.99,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}so I can't imagine what I can offer.
