Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:36.84,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and there was no talking him out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:45.48,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马蒂有一个最大的毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:45.48,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know, Marty's single big problem was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:47.08,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就是他从来都不了解自己
