Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.73,0:12:21.09,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}提供宗教教育作为公立学校外的另一种选择
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.73,0:12:21.09,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}as an alternative to public school in the rural communities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:25.01,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}部分原因在于州内辍学人数众多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:25.01,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, part of the reason there was so many dropouts in the state,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:27.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}许多孩子要乘一个多小时的公车才能到学校
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:27.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}a lot of kids had to bus an hour or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:31.75,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道在鹈鹕岛上的那所学校吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:31.75,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know about that school on Pelican Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.39,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I don't know it specific,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:37.13,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不过有一所...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:37.13,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but there was one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:40.06,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}在1988年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:40.06,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}in 1988.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:46.58,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为被指控性侵儿童而关停了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:46.58,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Accusations of children being interfered with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.95,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我没找到关于这事的记录
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.95,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I never found anything on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:55.21,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}记录可能被封闭了吧 我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:55.21,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It was...it was kept internal, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:58.67,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}或许没这事 或许人们被收买了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:58.67,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Maybe it was nothing, maybe people was paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.23,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这事跟我没关系 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.23,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's got nothing to do with me, mind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:02.51,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那时我在巴顿鲁日的学院
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:02.51,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I was going to school in Baton Rouge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:05.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}流言传遍了神学院
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:05.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Gossip around the seminary,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:08.14,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是我们不相信这些谣言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:08.14,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but we didn't give credence to rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:11.53,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你为什么离开?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:11.53,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why'd you leave?
