Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:14.70,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Bureaucracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:17.12,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}政治事务
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:17.12,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Politics.
