Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:27.30,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.26,0:13:31.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你为什么离开?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.26,0:13:31.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why'd you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:40.46,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们工作的一部分是学院内务
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:40.46,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Part of our lay duties was custodial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:48.52,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}一天晚上 我在打扫高级牧师的书房
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:48.52,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}One night, cleaned the senior minister's library.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:51.51,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}撞倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:51.51,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I knocked over
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:53.96,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}一本十分古老的书
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:53.96,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}a very old volume,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:57.26,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}《提利欧斯 德洛卡福音》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:57.26,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}"The Letters of Telios DeLorca."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.81,0:14:01.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}十二世纪方济会的福音书 非常晦涩难懂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.81,0:14:01.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Twelfth-century Franciscan mystic, very obscure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:07.43,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我拿起那本书 一个小文件夹掉了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:07.43,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}When I picked up the book, this little folder falls out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.51,0:14:12.23,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}文件夹里全是照片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.51,0:14:12.23,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Little folder of pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:17.27,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}小孩的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:17.27,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Pictures of children.
