Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:22.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.35,0:14:26.75,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}看上去像是在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.35,0:14:26.75,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Looked like they was sleeping.
