Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:29.51,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And what'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:34.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我给道德官法拉执事看了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:34.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I took it over to the morals officer, Deacon Farrar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:36.13,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他和塔特尔牧师关系很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:36.13,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He was close to Tuttle,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.82,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是神学院的副校长
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.82,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}vice president of the college.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:39.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他什么也没做?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:39.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He didn't do nothin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.51,0:14:42.52,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不 他似乎...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.51,0:14:42.52,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, he seemed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:45.07,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他很生气我带这些东西去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:45.07,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}he got angry that I brought it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:48.73,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他甚至以为我是去为这事忏悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:48.73,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He even intimated that maybe I was confessing to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:53.96,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我只得向他证明不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:53.96,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I mean, I had to prove to him that I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:58.26,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他答应我会调查这事...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:58.26,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He promised to look into it...
