Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:09.31,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why'd you quit the revival, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:14.70,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们最后两个临时场所被毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:14.70,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, our last two tents was vandalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:18.33,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没信心了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:18.33,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I lost heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:21.09,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}加上酗酒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:21.09,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Little too much of this.
