Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:42.40,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, it wasn't as bad as it seemed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.97,0:15:44.23,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}比其他地方好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.97,0:15:44.23,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Better than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:46.51,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}简是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:46.51,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Jan was a decent lady.
