Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.97,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I heard she sold The Ranch a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:50.95,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}真不敢相信是你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:50.95,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I can't believe that was you.
