Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.08,0:16:01.95,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, it's just... just so great
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:03.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:03.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}how you turned everything around.
