Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I ain't been...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}可不怎么英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}too heroic of late.
