Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:25.86,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:29.21,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所有人都能看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:29.21,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Anybody can see that.
