Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:38.01,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}God gave us these flaws,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:40.84,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我学到的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:40.84,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and something I learned...
