Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.75,0:27:57.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Women, then children.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.16,0:27:59.85,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没有相关报道
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.16,0:27:59.85,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Now they're getting no press,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.62,0:28:03.62,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}在河口发生的事没有被报道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.62,0:28:03.62,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}the way things in the bayou get no press.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.91,0:28:05.55,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这些都发生在伏都教
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.91,0:28:05.55,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And it's happening in the same area
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:07.64,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}传教的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:07.64,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}where that Voudon shit goes down,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.69,0:28:08.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}也都发生在
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.69,0:28:08.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and it's happening in the
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.42,0:28:11.14,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}建那些学校的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.42,0:28:11.14,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}same area where those schools were set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.14,0:28:12.61,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你在说什么狗屁学校呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.14,0:28:12.61,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What the fuck schools you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.61,0:28:16.38,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}比利 李 塔特尔创立的给山区
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.61,0:28:16.38,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Tuition reimbursement programs for rural and Christian schools
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.38,0:28:18.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}以及教会学校的教育偿还款计划
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.38,0:28:18.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}founded by Billy Lee Tuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.92,0:28:20.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}仔细想想看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.92,0:28:20.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah. Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.65,0:28:24.04,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}95年的时候 他为什么上赶着来这里?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.65,0:28:24.04,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Back in '95, why was he so fired up to get his ass down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.04,0:28:26.39,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}带着自己的特别小组插手
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.04,0:28:26.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He comes barging in with his task force.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.11,0:28:30.15,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}操 我们还没开始这个案子他就插手了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.11,0:28:30.15,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Fuck, before we even got started on the case, he took it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.43,0:28:31.35,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.43,0:28:31.35,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.50,0:28:34.13,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为他发现了一些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.50,0:28:34.13,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}'Cause he recognized something in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.98,0:28:36.94,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们深陷泥淖了 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.98,0:28:36.94,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We're in a muddy swamp here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.27,0:28:40.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}周围全是鳄鱼 可我们甚至
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.27,0:28:40.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The alligators are swimming around us,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.54,0:28:42.46,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不知道它们在不在 知道为什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.54,0:28:42.46,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and we don't even know whether they're there. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.90,0:28:46.20,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为我们看不见它们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.90,0:28:46.20,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}'Cause we don't see 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.71,0:28:49.17,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我觉得你都是在胡扯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.71,0:28:49.17,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I caught zero logic in all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:50.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}尤其是最后那部分?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:50.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And that last bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.84,0:28:51.98,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}简直是一派胡言
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.84,0:28:51.98,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Pure gibberish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.04,0:28:54.58,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不如我们调查一下所有
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.04,0:28:54.58,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}How about we track all the missing persons
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.58,0:28:56.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}离沃尔玛十六公里以内的失踪者?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.58,0:28:56.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}within 10 miles of every Walmart, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.80,0:28:59.28,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}沿10号公路 不如从山姆会员店开始
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.80,0:28:59.28,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Right along the I-10. Why don't we go after Sam Walmart?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:01.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我要带你去检查一下精神问题
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:01.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm fixing to pull you for mental exhaustion, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.69,0:29:03.66,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你还想继续这份工作吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.69,0:29:03.66,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You want to stay on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.66,0:29:06.72,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不要再和州里任何人说那些话
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.66,0:29:06.72,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Do not ever, ever say that to anyone in State again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.11,0:29:08.85,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.11,0:29:08.85,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.56,0:29:13.61,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你他妈真是有勇气啊 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.56,0:29:13.61,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's some fuckin' nerve you got, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.47,0:29:15.90,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你少来惹我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.47,0:29:15.90,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You need to take a few steps back,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.90,0:29:19.10,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}拉斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.90,0:29:19.10,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Rust, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.40,0:29:21.87,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}别再去造访受害者的家人了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.40,0:29:21.87,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No more visiting victims' families.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.87,0:29:23.55,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你没有任何嫌疑人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.87,0:29:23.55,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You will stop trying to turn missing persons
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.55,0:29:25.82,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}别再把那些失踪案变成谋杀案
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.55,0:29:25.82,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}into homicides, as you do not have any bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.82,0:29:27.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这是直接命令 听到没?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.82,0:29:27.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's a direct fuckin' order, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.50,0:29:29.49,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你再乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.50,0:29:29.49,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You do anything else, I'll have
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.49,0:29:31.85,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我会以违背上级命令的名义将你停职
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.49,0:29:31.85,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}you on insubordination, and I will suspend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.43,0:29:33.76,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}麻烦您老人家花点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.43,0:29:33.76,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Please, take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.77,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}去跟他们钓钓鱼什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.77,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Go on one of them fishing tours or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.77,0:29:37.40,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}好好调整一下
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.77,0:29:37.40,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}All right? Get yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.22,0:29:56.08,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不到两年之前
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.22,0:29:56.08,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And a little less than two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.40,0:29:59.14,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}塔特尔死于用药过度 都认为是意外
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.40,0:29:59.14,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Tuttle overdosed. Accidentally, supposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.38,0:30:00.87,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你已经提过了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.38,0:30:00.87,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You mentioned that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.89,0:30:02.32,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}塔特尔死的几周前
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.89,0:30:02.32,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Couple weeks before he died,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.32,0:30:04.46,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有人潜入了他在薛夫波特的家
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.32,0:30:04.46,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Tuttle's house in Shreveport was broken into.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.46,0:30:06.72,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}以及在巴顿鲁日的家
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.46,0:30:06.72,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Found out his Baton Rouge one was, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.08,0:30:08.25,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没有报告
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.08,0:30:08.25,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Wasn't reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:10.29,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:10.29,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.75,0:30:12.68,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以你的搭档非常想抓到塔特尔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.75,0:30:12.68,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}So your man gets a hard-on for Tuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.78,0:30:14.27,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}科尔刚回到州里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.78,0:30:14.27,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Man's house gets broken into right after
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.27,0:30:16.20,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就有人潜入塔特尔家
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.27,0:30:16.20,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Cohle turns back up in the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.66,0:30:18.77,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}自那之后他在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.66,0:30:18.77,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What's he been doing since, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.00,0:30:21.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}喝酒 调酒?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.00,0:30:21.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Drinking, bartending?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.09,0:30:22.03,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有这种想法的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.09,0:30:22.03,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Dude with a mind like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.03,0:30:23.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你觉得他只想做这些事吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.03,0:30:23.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}you think that's all he get up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:27.26,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马蒂 他哪里都没去
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:27.26,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Marty, he'd never went anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.74,0:30:28.78,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他没离开过
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.74,0:30:28.78,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He never left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.57,0:30:32.52,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他一直在这里干坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.57,0:30:32.52,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He's been right here doing bad things a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:39.91,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}等一下 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:39.91,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Hey, hey, hey. Hold up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.65,0:30:43.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我在这屋子里待得够久了 先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.65,0:30:43.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Been in this room a long time, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.02,0:30:49.89,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不管拉斯特是或曾经是 或者变成了...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.02,0:30:49.89,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Whatever Rust is or was or became...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.30,0:30:52.71,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}别再找我了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.30,0:30:52.71,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}don't call me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.42,0:30:54.64,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不会帮你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.42,0:30:54.64,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I won't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.85,0:30:56.31,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们想帮他 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.85,0:30:56.31,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We're trying to help him, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.55,0:31:23.97,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}今天过得怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.55,0:31:23.97,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Hey, did you have a good day?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.25,0:31:27.44,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你怎么不干脆把浴室都打扫了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.25,0:31:27.44,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, why don't you get that bathroom cleaned finally, huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.44,0:31:28.84,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}把牙膏都洗掉?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.44,0:31:28.84,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}get all the toothpaste up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.68,0:31:30.56,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.68,0:31:30.56,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.09,0:32:07.71,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马蒂 我不知道你在家
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.09,0:32:07.71,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Marty, I didn't know you were home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.11,0:32:10.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是啊 我在洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.11,0:32:10.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, yeah, I'm just cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.80,0:32:12.03,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马上就好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.80,0:32:12.03,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Be out in a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.88,0:32:18.31,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我去热点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.88,0:32:18.31,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'll heat up something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.45,0:32:21.74,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那些花真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.45,0:32:21.74,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Hey, those flowers came in nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.29,0:32:24.99,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你没说错 它们妆点了整个院子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.29,0:32:24.99,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You were right. They really brighten up the yard.
