Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.05,0:38:05.86,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}从八十年代中期到九十年代早期
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.05,0:38:05.86,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}mid-eighties through the early nineties.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.86,0:38:07.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你还记得吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.86,0:38:07.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.19,0:38:09.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}当然记得
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.19,0:38:09.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, of course I remember, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.46,0:38:13.61,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我想找到过去那些人 教员
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.46,0:38:13.61,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm trying to locate old personnel, faculty,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.61,0:38:16.21,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但我找名单时遇到一点小麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.61,0:38:16.21,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but I'm having a little bit of trouble acquiring names.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.21,0:38:17.96,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}计划已经正式终止
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.21,0:38:17.96,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, the program was shut down officially,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.96,0:38:19.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有十年了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.96,0:38:19.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}you know, maybe 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.80,0:38:21.45,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我对这个计划了解不是很多
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.80,0:38:21.45,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I never had much ground contact with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.45,0:38:24.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但有很多私立学校
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.45,0:38:24.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but it involved a number of private schools...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.53,0:38:25.85,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}和公司都参与了 你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.53,0:38:25.85,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}enterprises, you understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.85,0:38:29.24,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这些机构愿意采用我们的课程标准 作为回报
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.85,0:38:29.24,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}that would adopt our standard of curriculum and, in return,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.24,0:38:32.95,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们得到贫困学生的教育偿还款
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.24,0:38:32.95,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}receive tuition reimbursement for underprivileged students.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.95,0:38:35.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你还有相关资料吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.95,0:38:35.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You got any files,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.36,0:38:38.18,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}比如教员名单?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.36,0:38:38.18,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}any list of faculty?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.28,0:38:39.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这正是我要说的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.28,0:38:39.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, that's what I'm getting at,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.02,0:38:40.64,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那些都是私立机构
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.02,0:38:40.64,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}is that these were private institutions,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.64,0:38:44.45,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以我恐怕你得去找他们的负责人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.64,0:38:44.45,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}so you'd have to track down their administrators, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.45,0:38:45.72,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}问题就在这
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.45,0:38:45.72,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.88,0:38:48.79,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所有学校都和计划一起消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.88,0:38:48.79,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}See, all the schools dissolved with the program,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.25,0:38:51.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我还试着去找过税务信息
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.25,0:38:51.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and I'm trying to find some tax info,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.05,0:38:53.74,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但他们都享受宗教税收豁免权
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.05,0:38:53.74,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but there were religious exemptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.74,0:38:56.52,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你可以试试我们的档案库
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.74,0:38:56.52,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, there's our archives, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.52,0:38:57.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}虽然我们也遗失了很多资料
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.52,0:38:57.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Now, we did lose a lot of files,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.81,0:39:01.66,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有一间地下室曾经淹过水
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.81,0:39:01.66,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}had some flooding of one of the sub-floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.72,0:39:04.28,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是 我觉得我应该可以
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.72,0:39:04.28,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}But, you know, I think I should put you together
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.28,0:39:05.58,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为你安排一位我们的教士员工
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.28,0:39:05.58,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}with one of our clerical workers and
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.58,0:39:07.85,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}看他们能否帮你找到点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.58,0:39:07.85,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}see if they can help you find something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.52,0:39:10.75,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}谢谢 在那之前
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.52,0:39:10.75,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Thank you. Listen, before you do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.75,0:39:16.13,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我想了解下你的前执事 奥斯汀 法拉
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.75,0:39:16.13,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}former deacon of yours, Austin Farrar.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.76,0:39:21.74,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那是段非常不幸的往事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.76,0:39:21.74,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That was very, very unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.34,0:39:23.98,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他是被解职的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.34,0:39:23.98,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yet he was dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.32,0:39:26.20,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}冒出过一些证据
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.32,0:39:26.20,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Evidence had accrued.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.38,0:39:28.79,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那些证据表明奥斯汀
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.38,0:39:28.79,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It became apparent that Austin had
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.79,0:39:31.98,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}使用过部分款项
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.79,0:39:31.98,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}implemented certain...funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.95,0:39:34.96,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}直说吧 就是"贪污"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.95,0:39:34.96,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, "Embezzling" is the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.96,0:39:36.90,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们选择内部处理
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.96,0:39:36.90,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We elected to handle it internally,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.90,0:39:39.60,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}而不是提出正式指控
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.90,0:39:39.60,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}rather than pursuing formal charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.86,0:39:43.38,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}然后他就出了意外
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.86,0:39:43.38,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}And then he had his...accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.99,0:39:48.83,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我听说他无法接受这件事 开始酗酒
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.99,0:39:48.83,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'd heard he had taken it hard, drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.89,0:39:54.34,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我见过最多的就是因喝酒断送人生的了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.89,0:39:54.34,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I've seen more souls lost down a bottle than any pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.76,0:39:57.18,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}同时
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.76,0:39:57.18,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}At the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.88,0:40:00.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你也不能相信一个连喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.88,0:40:00.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}it's hard to trust a man who can't trust himself
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.42,0:40:02.82,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}都控制不了的人 你说呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.42,0:40:02.82,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}with a beer, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.76,0:40:07.89,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们为什么谈起这个呢? ...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.76,0:40:07.89,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}But what's this all about now? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.13,0:40:12.62,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}思源计划 奥斯汀 法拉?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.13,0:40:12.62,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Wellspring program, Austin Farrar?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.62,0:40:14.18,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}因为死了女人和儿童
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.62,0:40:14.18,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Dead women and children.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.25,0:40:19.16,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.25,0:40:19.16,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.19,0:40:21.28,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}实在太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.19,0:40:21.28,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.68,0:40:25.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你的调查进行的怎么样了?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.68,0:40:25.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}How is that what you're working on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.02,0:40:29.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}目前我还不能透露任何事 神父
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.02,0:40:29.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, I can't say anything about it at this point, Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.29,0:40:34.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我给你引荐一位员工
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.29,0:40:34.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'd like to set you up with a clerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.15,0:40:40.34,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你可以查阅
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.15,0:40:40.34,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You can look at, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.08,0:40:45.91,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们现存的一切有关思源计划的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.08,0:40:45.91,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}whatever information we still have from Wellspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.36,0:40:54.04,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}思源计划为什么会终止 神父?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.36,0:40:54.04,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Why'd the Wellspring program shut down, Reverend?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.34,0:40:56.68,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们拿不出那么多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.34,0:40:56.68,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It couldn't sustain its costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.26,0:40:58.54,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}计划的理念是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.26,0:40:58.54,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The whole idea was to provide
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.54,0:41:02.55,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}在公立学校所宣扬的去宗教化全球教育之外
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.54,0:41:02.55,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}an alternative to the kind of secular, globalized education
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.55,0:41:05.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}为人们提供另一种选择
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.55,0:41:05.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}that our public schools were promoting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.41,0:41:08.27,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}学校资助计划成立之后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.41,0:41:08.27,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}When we get the school voucher program instituted,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.27,0:41:10.29,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们就会重新提出这个理念
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.27,0:41:10.29,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}we'll reintroduce the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.89,0:41:14.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}像其他事一样 人们应该有选择教育的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.89,0:41:14.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}People should have a choice in education, like anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.05,0:41:18.13,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}史蒂夫 请你帮这位警探
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.05,0:41:18.13,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Steve, would you show the detective
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.13,0:41:21.39,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}找出外部教会事物的档案?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.13,0:41:21.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}to our old archives for outside ministries?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.39,0:41:23.47,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 好的神父 - 我先给他们打个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.39,0:41:23.47,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- Yes, sir. - I'll call ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.47,0:41:24.81,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我改天再来查资料
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.47,0:41:24.81,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'm gonna come back for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.81,0:41:26.85,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}神父 感谢你抽时间见我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.81,0:41:26.85,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Reverend, thank you for your time today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.27,0:41:30.89,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}祝你顺利 警探
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.27,0:41:30.89,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Godspeed, Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.02,0:41:36.55,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我会为你祈祷的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.02,0:41:36.55,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You'll be in my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.89,0:41:41.90,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就一次好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.89,0:41:41.90,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, just the one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.99,0:41:44.35,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我只想再要一次
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.99,0:41:44.35,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I just need it...I just need it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.01,0:41:48.21,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}贝丝 你都不知道我今天过得多糟...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.01,0:41:48.21,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Beth, if you knew the day I just had...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.24,0:41:53.17,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}说吧 告诉我 我想听
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.24,0:41:53.17,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, then tell me about it. I want to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.21,0:41:59.04,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不 你不想
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.21,0:41:59.04,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, you do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.01,0:42:03.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我真的很想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.01,0:42:03.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I really wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.76,0:42:07.10,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我一整个星期都在想某件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.76,0:42:07.10,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I've been thinking about something all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.10,0:42:09.48,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 别这样 - 自从上次见面开始
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.10,0:42:09.48,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- Don't. - Ever since last time.
